          "text": "Most of AMD’s top 10x AI engineers are in Shanghai  This includes AMD’s MoRI collective and UMBP KV-cache offloading and pooling team, its disaggregated-applications forward-deployed engineering team, and other AMD teams that understand how to approach inference engineering",
